== Walkthrough ==

Hail her, and she says "Greetings to you. I seek those who call themselves wizards. Are you a wizard, ____?"

You say, 'I am a wizard'

She says "I thought so. I have several tasks for you to accomplish. Once you have completed them I will have a cap, a robe, sleeves, wristbands, gloves, leggings, and boots to reward you with."

'''After turn-in:'''

Mauren Frostbeard smiles warmly as he hands you your reward. 'You have done well, _____.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Coldain]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Dain Frostreaver IV]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Kromzek]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Kromrif]] got worse.
</div>
{{YouGainExperience}}

== Helm ==

''Dialogue needed.''

Mauren promises to make you a cap if you bring him a [[Torn Enchanted Silk Turban]] and three pieces of [[Crushed Flame Opal]].

== Robe ==

You say 'what robe'

She says "If you wish to have a fine robe, bring unto me a torn enchanted silk robe and three pristine emeralds.  Then you will receive a robe beyond your wildest dreams."

Mauren promises to make you a robe if you bring him a [[Torn Enchanted Silk Robe]] and three [[Pristine Emerald]]s.

== Sleeves ==

''Dialogue needed.''

