You say 'what boots'

She says "Three crushed jaundice gems combined with torn enchanted silk boots would make a most interesting set of footwear. The latent powers of the gems can be harnessed to create magical effects."

Mauren promises to make you boots if you bring him [[Torn Enchanted Silk Boots]] and three [[Crushed Jaundice Gem]]s.

